# PATCH CONTEXT
# Why: Rainbow's AnimatedText provides a line-height fix node as a child,
#   and react-native-animateable-text forwards children at runtime. The
#   package's published declarations nevertheless omit TextProps.children,
#   making that supported composition fail with TS2322. Keep the package's
#   three public declaration surfaces aligned with its runtime behavior.
# Upstream Issue: none filed — the package declarations and source prop type
#   should retain NativeTextProps.children.
# Linear Issue: FEPLAT-98
# Remove when: react-native-animateable-text ships a release where
#   lib/typescript/src/{index,TextProps,AnimateableText.web}.d.ts admit
#   NativeTextProps.children.

diff --git a/node_modules/react-native-animateable-text/lib/typescript/src/AnimateableText.web.d.ts b/node_modules/react-native-animateable-text/lib/typescript/src/AnimateableText.web.d.ts
